{"id":"n62254-2-7","stage":1,"title":"날 · 白天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62254-2-7-1","ko":"승규 씨, 집에 안 가요? 벌써 날이 저물었어요.","zh":"承奎，你不回家吗？天都已经黑了哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨,","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날이","meaning":"白天","explanation":"날：白天；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"2","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저물었어요.","meaning":"日落，天黑","explanation":"저물다：日落，天黑；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"저물다","audio":"/audio/02ebc83eefc021a83c94.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74863","senseId":"1","lemma":"저물다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"白天","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"一天中明亮的时间。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"02ebc83eefc021a8","term":"저물다","zh":"日落，天黑","audio":"/audio/02ebc83eefc021a83c94.mp3","entryId":"74863","definition":"太阳下山，天色变暗。","pronunciation":["저물다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3e6ea5964bebd0fdca18.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62254-2-7-2","ko":"벌써요? 네, 곧 가겠습니다.","zh":"已经这么晚了？嗯，我马上就回去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써요?","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가겠습니다.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a136777e7d30f1093ae.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.236,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62254","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":33,"sequenceScore":1.4521,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["承奎，你不回家吗？天都已经黑了哦。","已经这么晚了？嗯，我马上就回去。","您多大年纪了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎，你不回家吗？天都已经黑了哦。","已经这么晚了？嗯，我马上就回去。","您多大年纪了？"],"answer":1}]}
